Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(planning):=20rattacher=20les=20prestas=20re?=
 =?UTF-8?q?nfort=20au=20devis=20par=20prix=20si=20le=20nom=20diff=C3=A8re?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
